      "side": 1,
      "message": "I was more afraid to touch the format of the non-machine output for that reason. I felt comfortable adding more lines to the machine output since anyone parsing that would use be pulling out key\u003dvalue between newlines.\n\n@Mary, thought?\n\n---\n\nI am landing the other simple CL since I want to use that to exclude certain RO update paths. I don\u0027t want to block that CL on how we figure out formatting for CLI output.",
